cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
sheet.1	1	converter	convert					the sheet of the input values is named by the title of the root schema
sheet.2	1	converter	convert					a kind's sheet with no title is named by the last reference token of its $ref
sheet.3	1	converter	convert					a name taken from the schema that begins with _ is written with that _ doubled
sheet.4	1	converter	convert					every other sheet is named by its parent sheet's name and its path's parts, each after a full stop
sheet.5	1	converter	convert					a member of a property written as its instance's own is labelled by that property's name, a full stop, and its own name
arguments
requirement	case	position	item	value
sheet.1	1	1	1	{"a": "x"}
sheet.1	1	2	0	{"title": "t", "type": "object", "properties": {"a": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["a"]}
sheet.1	1	3	0	0
sheet.2	1	1	1	{"p": {"v": "x"}}
sheet.2	1	2	0	{"title": "t", "type": "object", "definitions": {"d": {"type": "object", "properties": {"v": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["v"]}}, "properties": {"p": {"$ref": "#/definitions/d"}}, "required": ["p"]}
sheet.2	1	3	0	0
sheet.3	1	1	1	{"_x": "y"}
sheet.3	1	2	0	{"title": "t", "type": "object", "properties": {"_x": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["_x"]}
sheet.3	1	3	0	0
sheet.4	1	1	1	{"a": "x", "b": ["p"]}
sheet.4	1	2	0	{"title": "t", "type": "object", "properties": {"a": {"type": "string"}, "b": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}}, "required": ["a"]}
sheet.4	1	3	0	0
sheet.5	1	1	1	{"o": {"v": "x"}}
sheet.5	1	2	0	{"title": "t", "type": "object", "properties": {"o": {"type": "object", "properties": {"v": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["v"]}}, "required": ["o"]}
sheet.5	1	3	0	0
